Custom Plastic Bag Packaging with Zip Lock Features
1. Full Customization Capability
Custom Plastic Bag Packaging supports comprehensive pattern and material customization, enabling businesses to create brand-aligned designs. Adopting high-precision digital printing for clear, consistent patterns, it offers food-grade composite materials like PET/PE, PET/VMPET/PE and PET/AL/PE to meet oil, moisture and oxygen resistance needs, ensuring tailored packaging solutions for specific products.
2. Multiple Zipper Types
Custom Plastic Bag Packaging comes with three food-grade zipper options (Regular, Pocket, Velcro) complying with FDA and GB 4806 standards. Regular Zippers ensure smooth use, Pocket Zippers enhance sealing to block air and moisture, while Velcro Zippers offer easy operation with clear opening/closing feedback, meeting diverse sealing and usage requirements for long-term reliable use.
3. Scientific Bag Style
Adopting SUP Pouch style, Custom Plastic Bag Packaging features excellent standing stability for better shelf display. With 95% space utilization and customizable size (5cm×8cm to 30cm×45cm), it enhances structural strength to reduce deformation during transportation and storage, suitable for diverse industrial packaging needs.
4. Premium Material Options
Custom Plastic Bag Packaging provides high-quality material combinations: PET/PE (transparency, toughness), PET/VMPET/PE (barrier, light-shielding), Matt OPP/VMPET/PE (matte texture) and PET/AL/PE (oxygen transmission rate<2cc>
5. Reliable Sealing Performance
Custom Plastic Bag Packaging achieves excellent sealing via high-quality zippers and precision heat-sealing (sealing strength 35N/15mm), extending product shelf life by 3-6 months. It effectively blocks air, moisture and impurities, ideal for perishable and moisture-sensitive products. The reusable zip lock maintains product freshness, enhancing packaging practicality.
1. Snack Food Industry
Custom Plastic Bag Packaging is ideal for snack manufacturers (potato chips, nuts, candies). Its excellent sealing prevents moisture absorption, maintaining taste and flavor. Businesses can customize pattern and size to print brand info, boosting market recognition, while its light weight and toughness reduce transportation costs and damage rates.
2. Beverage & Liquid Food Industry
For beverage powder and instant mixes, Custom Plastic Bag Packaging offers reliable moisture resistance and leak-proof performance. PET/AL/PE material ensures long-term quality stability via strong barrier properties. Businesses can select zippers and customize capacity for single/family-serve, with customizable printing highlighting product and brand advantages.
3. Daily Chemical Products Industry
Custom Plastic Bag Packaging is widely used for laundry detergent pods, masks and wet wipes. Customizable oil and chemical resistant materials prevent packaging damage, while the zip lock maintains product freshness after each use. Personalized patterns match brand positioning, making it stand out in the competitive market.
4. Pharmaceutical & Health Product Industry
Pharmaceutical and health product manufacturers use Custom Plastic Bag Packaging for supplements and herbal extracts. Pharmaceutical-grade materials ensure no contamination, while high barrier properties protect active ingredients from light, moisture and oxygen. Anti-counterfeiting printing and instruction customization improve traceability and consumer trust.
5. E-commerce Retail Industry
E-commerce retailers prefer Custom Plastic Bag Packaging for its transportation and storage performance. Good puncture and compression resistance reduce product damage, while brand logos and service info printing enhances exposure and customer experience. Customizable size adapts to diverse products, with light weight controlling logistics costs for cost-effectiveness.
