- No downtime allows you to return to your daily activities immediately.
What Are the Types of Neurotoxin Injections?
At RxWellness in Wolf Trap, VA, we offer a comprehensive range of FDA-approved neurotoxin injections to address various aesthetic concerns:
The most widely recognized brand, Botox effectively treats forehead lines, crow’s feet, and frown lines. It’s also used for jawline slimming and treating hyperhidrosis.
Known for its quick onset and natural-looking results, Dysport excels in softening glabellar lines and forehead wrinkles. Its tendency to spread makes it ideal for larger treatment areas.
This “naked” neurotoxin, containing only the active ingredient, potentially reduces the risk of antibody formation. It’s particularly effective for frown lines and patients who’ve developed resistance to other neurotoxins.
Often called “Newtox,” this relatively new option is FDA-approved for treating glabellar lines and is popular among younger patients as a preventative treatment.
The latest innovation in neurotoxin treatments, Daxxify offers longer-lasting results, potentially up to 6-9 months. It’s an excellent choice for those seeking extended intervals between treatments.
During your personalized consultation at RxWellness in Wolf Trap, VA, our expert practitioners will assess your unique needs and aesthetic goals to recommend the most suitable neurotoxin treatment for you.
