From Untapped Resource to Smart Collaboration: Water in Focus
We bring together stakeholders, expertise, and ideas to explore how industrial symbiosis can create value from water flows that are currently being lost. Ongoing projects, as well as experiences from projects that achieved less successful outcomes, will be presented to share knowledge, insights, and lessons learned.
Harvesting the Power of Industrial and Urban Symbiosis: Collaboration Towards Complexity Presentation by Murat Mirata, Linköping University
Långeberga Water Collaboration Presentation by Christina Zoric, City of Helsingborg
Panel discussion with representatives from private sector and municipal industrial symbiosis initiatives -What is the potential of water and industrial symbiosis? -What are the incentives for users and industry to participate? -What challenges have the projects faced?

