What You Will Find on Our Lot in Richmond
Selection is one of those things that is easy to claim and harder to prove. At Safford Volkswagen West Richmond, we keep a wide cross-section of trims and configurations on the ground so that when you visit, you are not stuck choosing between two cars in the wrong color. That includes value-focused base trims and SEL Premium and SEL R-Line variants for shoppers who want the loaded interior treatment.
Our team has been selling Volkswagens for a long time, and there is a real difference between a salesperson who memorized a brochure and one who has actually driven every model through a Virginia winter. We aim for the second category.
