The AluRack Construction features heavy-duty crossbars designed to handle the maximum payload authorised by the van’s manufacturer and is ideal if you wish to accessorise it with an additional platform.
Side rails are 163 mm high (above the mountings).
Made entirely from aluminium — including the mountings — for maximum durability, light weight, and corrosion resistance.
Installation requires no drilling into the van.
