Percussion strengthens, refines and colors your music
Welcome to Second Wind Studio: your address for tailor-made percussion tracks that give your music its very own and special sound. After many years of touring and recording, gathering many experiences and developing my own unique sound and setups, I have decided to open up my own studio to offer artists and groups around the world the opportunity to use my percussive skills and imagination to help them realize their musical dreams.
