Is this an officially licensed Kath and Kim t-shirt?
No, this is a hand-drawn fan tribute by artist The Shit Files in collaboration with Lonely Kids Club. Not affiliated with Kath & Kim, the ABC, or any production company. Just a loving homage for fans of the show.
What's on the design?
Kath Day-Knight (just Kath, not Kim) in a vintage retro layout. The Shit Files brings her signature style to a classic Aussie aesthetic — designed to evoke the era and spirit of the show.
Is there a Kim version?
This design features Kath only. If demand is strong, we might look at a Kim design in future — follow us on socials to hear about new releases.
Is this a good gift for Kath & Kim fans?
Absolutely. For any Kath and Kim fan who has Kath as their favourite (foxymorons among us) or just appreciates the mum half of the duo, this one's for them. Also works for fans of retro Australian aesthetics and vintage 80s-style layouts.
Is this a limited edition?
Yes. Strictly limited time only. Once it's gone, it's gone.
