		Business / Provider Profile
		ShiftCare started in 2016, founded by Gaurav Cheema. With a connection to the care industry, Gaurav recognised the need for a shift in the way NDIS providers managed their business. He envisioned a world where the care sector thrived on the kind of technological advancements that many sectors already considered standard.
Leveraging his expertise and understanding of the industry's challenges, Gaurav assembled a team brimming with passion and dedication. Today, ShiftCare stands as a powerful technology platform, revolutionising how care services are delivered across Australia by helping thousands of providers.
		The difference we make
At the heart of our software lies a profound understanding of the people-centric nature of your industry. Every individual is unique, and every need is distinct. With ShiftCare, it's not just about optimising resources; it's about enhancing experiences for both your team and those you serve.
In Australia, support providers grapple with staying compliant while striving to ensure optimal care for their clients. The limitations of traditional tools like emails and basic spreadsheets have become evident.
ShiftCare steps in with a purpose-built solution, alleviating these challenges. We present an adaptable tool suitable for diverse businesses, eliminating the necessity for extensive IT implementations.
We make it easier and simpler for support providers to track and manage shifts, and organise payment, giving them more time for client care.
Like any business based around people, support work is different every time. By securely sharing information, we help bring a little more consistency to clients.
From accurate tracking of hours, to automated invoicing and detailed record keeping, ShiftCare is trusted to deliver certainty when it matters most.
