Hello all and welcome to our April Release week at Flourishes! One thing you’ll notice, right off the bat, is that this release will have a very feminine feel! It’s that time of year when we start to think about honoring the moms in our lives and watching parts of the world turn to spring! So, without further ado, let’s sneak peek our first set!
I used Flourishes Classic White Cardstock along with the pretty patterned paper from Prima called Medowlark.
What’s more beautiful than an antique cameo? This set illustrated by Lauren Pope showcases that feel. Stamp the silhouette in the center of this circle antique lace frame or use one of the six beautifully scripted sentiments inside. It’s a timeless and classic image that can honor your mom or any new mom in your life! This set measures 4″ by 6″. This set is a perfect companion to our Antique Lace background stamp. It’s another brand new stamp! See?
Want to win this set? All you need to do is leave some love in the form of a comment on the blogs below! Why? You need to try to figure out…..
One of the ladies on our link list below will be picking a name from the comments on her blog post today. We don’t know which one it is… so the more blogs you leave comments on, the more chances you have to win!
