Menara UOA Bangsar is a prominent Grade A corporate office development located in the heart of Bangsar, Kuala Lumpur. Strategically positioned along Jalan Bangsar Utama 1, this commercial complex consists of two towers—Tower A (39 storeys) and Tower B (24 storeys)—offering a mix of business suites suitable for both investors and tenants. Tower A units are available for sale, while Tower B offers rental-only spaces, making it ideal for various business needs.
One of the biggest advantages of Menara UOA Bangsar is its exceptional accessibility. It is directly connected to the Bangsar LRT Station (Kelana Jaya Line) via a covered pedestrian link bridge, allowing employees and visitors to travel seamlessly via public transport. From Bangsar LRT, it is only one stop to KL Sentral, Malaysia’s main transportation hub which connects to MRT, KTM, ERL, and airport transit lines. The building is also accessible via major highways such as the Federal Highway, Kerinchi Link, New Pantai Expressway (NPE), and SPRINT, offering excellent road connectivity to areas like Petaling Jaya, Damansara, and Kuala Lumpur city centre.
In terms of amenities, Menara UOA Bangsar is well-equipped to meet the needs of modern businesses. The development includes a three-storey retail podium featuring various food and beverage outlets, convenience stores, cafes, a clinic, an optical shop, and a money changer. The office towers feature high-speed elevators, fibre optic internet, 24-hour security with CCTV surveillance, access card control systems, and centralized air-conditioning (in Tower B). Each office suite comes with private toilets, pantries, and in some units, even shower rooms.
The location is also surrounded by established landmarks and facilities. Within a short distance, one can find Bangsar Village, Mid Valley Megamall, The Gardens Mall, and Telawi’s lifestyle district filled with eateries, boutiques, and nightlife options. Hotels such as The Gardens Hotel, Alila Bangsar, and Aloft KL Sentral are also nearby, making it convenient for business travellers and corporate events. For healthcare needs, Pantai Hospital and Universiti Malaya Medical Centre are just minutes away.
Menara UOA Bangsar offers an ideal blend of location, connectivity, and facilities, making it a top choice for businesses seeking a prestigious address with excellent infrastructure. With its direct LRT access, modern amenities, and a vibrant surrounding community, this office tower remains one of the most sought-after business addresses in the Klang Valley.
