The InnoView 23.8-Inch 144Hz FHD Portable Gaming Monitor offers a significant upgrade in screen real estate for users who require a high-performance display on the go. Featuring a massive 23.8-inch IPS panel with Full HD 1080P resolution, this monitor delivers crisp visuals and wide 178-degree viewing angles. The standout 144Hz refresh rate ensures buttery-smooth motion during fast-paced gameplay and video editing, while the 100% sRGB color gamut and HDR support provide vibrant, professional-grade color accuracy for content creators and entertainment enthusiasts alike.
Designed for maximum versatility, the InnoView 23.8-Inch 144Hz FHD Portable Gaming Monitor is equipped with a built-in 180-degree adjustable kickstand that allows for the perfect viewing angle in any environment. This ergonomic stand supports both landscape and portrait orientations, making it an ideal choice for coding, reading, or standard gaming setups. The integrated DC eye care technology, including low blue light and flicker-free settings, reduces strain during long hours of use, ensuring that users can work or play comfortably for extended periods without fatigue.
Compatibility is a key strength of the InnoView 23.8-Inch 144Hz FHD Portable Gaming Monitor, as it features dual USB-C and full-sized HDMI ports. This extensive connectivity allows it to function seamlessly as a second screen for laptops, MacBooks, and desktop PCs, while also supporting direct connections to smartphones and popular consoles like the PS4, PS5, Xbox, and Nintendo Switch. Whether used for boosting productivity in a home office or providing a large-scale gaming experience during travel, this lightweight and ultra-slim monitor combines the power of a desktop display with the flexibility of a portable device.
