B. Sound Options
Spiritual literature of all times and parts of the world talks about the Primal Sound or Word that creates and sustains the whole of creation. It is no surprise that sound is particularly powerful in our self-healing process, whether it is the sound of the voice, song, harmonic overtones, music and especially the frequency of our words. Sounds create coherent and non-coherent patterns in our physical-emotional-mental energy field.
The intention of the following Sound Options is to use sound frequencies to create new coherent patterns of well-being.

Behind Mizunara Chalet’s bold appearance and rectangular-shaped façade lies a warm and ultra-stylish four-bedroom luxury mountain lodge which can sleep up to ten people. Centrally located in Hirafu’s lower village, this chalet is an excellent choice for anyone who appreciates modern architecture and minimalist design.
Its split-level layout, open-plan living, comfortable lounge areas, and gorgeous L-shaped kitchen provide a real sense of space, with plenty of areas for socialising with loved ones. With two king-size master bedrooms, a queen-size guest bedroom and an additional bunk bedroom perfect for children, this stunning chalet is an ideal alpine retreat for a family or a group of friends.
Thank you for the wonderful memories made in this beautiful home. The view of the winter wonderland was second to none. A very helpful team of staff as well.
