Graph Geometry Interaction Learning
While numerous approaches have been developed to embed graphs into either Euclidean or hyperbolic spaces, they do not fully utilize the information available in graphs, or lack the flexibility to model intrinsic complex graph geometry. To utilize the strength of both Euclidean and hyperbolic geometries, we develop a novel Geometry Interaction Learning (GIL) method for graphs, a well-suited and efficient alternative for learning abundant geometric properties in graph. GIL captures a more informative internal structural features with low dimensions while maintaining conformal invariance of each space. Furthermore, our method endows each node the freedom to determine the importance of each geometry space via a flexible dual feature interaction learning and probability assembling mechanism. Promising experimental results are presented for five benchmark datasets on node classification and link prediction tasks.

2024 Mercedes-Benz GLB Owner's Manual
Table of Contents
2024 Mercedes-Benz GLB Overview
The 2024 Mercedes-Benz GLB is a marvel of engineering that combines practicality with luxury. This compact SUV stands out not just for its striking design, but also for its versatility and advanced technology. Offering a spacious interior and a family-friendly layout, the GLB caters to both urban dwellers and adventurers alike, making it ideal for those seeking both comfort and capability in their daily drive.
The 2024 GLB is powered by a range of robust powertrains that cater to different driving preferences. The base model is equipped with a turbocharged 2.0-liter inline-four engine that delivers 221 horsepower and 258 lb-ft of torque, achieving a smooth blend of performance and efficiency. For those seeking more dynamism, the GLB 35 AMG variant ramps up the excitement with a turbocharged 2.0-liter engine that produces 302 horsepower. Both engine options provide seamless shifts through an 8-speed automatic transmission and come bundled with the renowned 4MATIC all-wheel-drive system for superior handling and grip in any condition.
The 2024 GLB is offered in multiple trims, including the GLB 250 and the high-performance GLB 35 AMG. Each trim comes with a well-rounded set of standard features, but higher trims offer enhanced amenities such as upgraded leather upholstery, advanced sound systems, and additional safety technologies. The GLB’s customizable options ensure that each owner can personalize their vehicle to their preferences.
Inside, the GLB boasts a modern and tech-savvy cabin complete with the latest MBUX infotainment system, featuring dual 10.25-inch displays for intuitive access to navigation, multimedia, and vehicle controls. Safety features are heightened with advanced driver-assistance systems including Active Brake Assist, Blind Spot Monitoring, and optional Adaptive Cruise Control, ensuring a secure journey at all times.
The 2024 Mercedes-Benz GLB comes with a comprehensive owner’s manual that provides essential information about the vehicle’s features, maintenance schedules, and troubleshooting. Designed for ease of use, the manual includes detailed instructions on operation and tips for maximizing performance, ensuring every owner can enjoy their GLB to its fullest potential.
User manual download
The Mercedes-Benz GLB owner manual for the 2024 model year is to be found in PDF downloadable format on this page. The owner manual for the model year 2024 is free and in English, but the repair manuals are usually not easy to get and may cost more.
