Visual Report FAQ
Questions about the bedroom feng shui visual report.
Is this a real report or a demo?
This page is a sample so you can see the format before uploading. Your report is generated from your own bedroom photo.
What does the free preview include?
A layout score style summary, top issues, one recommended first fix, and an annotated image preview. Sign-in is required to run analysis; new accounts include free analyses.
What does the full report include?
An HD annotated image, before/after style guidance, complete issue list with priority, what to fix first, compromises when furniture cannot move, and renter-friendly fixes.
How is the annotated image created?
The AI reviews your bedroom photo, identifies visible layout elements, then draws labels and paths for door lines, mirror reflections, window pressure, and related issues on the image.
Do I need a perfect photo?
No. A clear phone photo that shows the bed, main door, and major furniture is enough. Floor plans also work.
