Grammy recognized and Blues Hall of Fame “Legendary Blues Artist” inductee Stevie Hawkins delivers a soulful new rendition of the iconic Leon Russell ballad "A Song For You." This heartfelt re-imagining blends his signature blues style with deep lyricism, bringing fresh emotion to the 1970 classic. This isn’t just a cover — it’s a resurrection of emotion. Listen to Stevie Hawkins channel pure soul. Hawkins’ rendition of "A Song For You" combines his signature emotive drums work with his rich, gravelly voice, infusing the song with a raw, heartfelt energy. The recording is layered with soulful piano, bass, and gentle horn and string arrangements that elevate the emotional weight of the lyrics, creating a soundscape that resonates deeply with listeners.
Following the success of his single "You Left Me With A Heartquake," Hawkins continues to redefine blues and soul with this powerful new release.
