GenesisLink is a Canadian business consulting firm supporting international and domestic entrepreneurs as they build, scale, and establish businesses in Canada. Since 2020, we’ve supported 300+ founders across 30+ countries, helping ventures progress from early validation to market entry, operations, and alignment with Canada’s business immigration pathways—working in coordination with legal and regulatory professionals where required. With 150%+ growth over the past three years, GenesisLink has been recognized as one of Canada’s fastest-growing firms in the innovation and entrepreneurship ecosystem.
