Start your Orange County getaway at Wyndham Anaheim, just off I-5 and steps from Disneyland® Resort attractions. Our contemporary, non-smoking hotel gives you easy access to Downtown Disney® District, as well as the world-famous Disneyland® Park and Disneyland California Adventure® Park. You can also attend special events at the Anaheim Convention Center & Arena, located across the street. Plus, John Wayne Airport (SNA) is just minutes away, making it easy to fly in and out of the area.
Whether business or vacation brings you here, you’ll appreciate enticing amenities such as our heated outdoor pool, hot tub, and state-of-the-art fitness center. Stay satiated with our restaurant, café, and 24/7 market. Remain productive in our business center and host a gathering of any kind with four polished venues. We also offer free parking in a gated underground lot ($30/day + tax prior to check-in), and there is no resort fee when you stay with us. Unwind in stylish accommodations with thoughtful conveniences like free WiFi and a CubieBlue entertainment system.

