Discover packages with known vulnerabilities, and the abandoned ones nobody has bumped in years.
osv-scanner — scanners used for Dependencies
Reduce bundle weight, render cost, and the Core Web Vitals a real user on a real phone feels.
lighthouse CI — scanners used for Performance
