Patriot Connect is now available!
Replacing disconnected tools like Navigate, Bookings, and Calendly, Patriot Connect is your new go-to platform for student success scheduling and accessing student support services such as academic advising, student success coaching, and learning services.
What can I do in Patriot Connect?
- Find your Success Team and access student support services: Connect with your assigned academic advisor, student success coach, program coordinator, and/or access support like learning services, career services, and more.
- Schedule appointments: View available time slots and book with your Success Team or support services.
- Access appointment notes and complete tasks: Review a running record of meeting notes captured by your advisors and support staff and complete any assigned tasks, such as scheduling and completing your referral appointments.
How does Patriot Connect fit among existing platforms?
- PatriotWeb: Will NOT go away; you will continue to use it for registration, paying bills, and other administrative tasks.
- Mason360: Will NOT go away; you will still use it as the campus engagement platform to find events and join student groups.
Getting started is simple: go to connect.gmu.edu and log in with your George Mason credentials. Don’t forget to save this link to your browser’s favorites for easy access.
Review the following videos and related resources to see how Patriot Connect works and how it can enhance your student experience.
If you encounter any issues logging in, need technical support, or experience challenges using assistive technology (i.e., screen readers) with Patriot Connect, please contact the Mason Student Services Center (MSSC).
- Submit a case here
  - Select “Patriot Connect” for the question, “Which area of the university do you need assistance with?”
- Email: [email protected]
- Phone: 703-993-2000
- Website: https://mssc.gmu.edu
Student Support Services Available in Patriot Connect
Expand the lists below to view the student support services that are available to all George Mason students through Patriot Connect.
