About the challenge
Apprenticeships expand career opportunities, but many adult learners face barriers to accessing them. Pre-apprenticeships break down these barriers by helping adults enter, prepare for, and succeed in apprenticeships and other industry roles.
The Rethink Adult Ed Challenge invited AEFLA-funded adult education providers to design innovative and high-quality pre-apprenticeship programs — in any industry, anywhere in the United States.
The U.S. Department of Education announced the winners of the Rethink Adult Ed Challenge on September 9, 2021. The five winners will receive a share of the $750,000 prize pool.
The challenge was conducted in two stages. During Stage 1, all eligible organizations were invited to submit a preliminary design of a pre-apprenticeship program. Ninety-five finalists were selected to progress to the Stage 2 virtual accelerator. Following scoring by a review panel and judging panel, five prize winners were selected.
Stage 1: Open submissions
Stage 2: Virtual accelerator
Total prize pool
In Stage 2, finalists participated in a virtual accelerator, which provided resources and support from subject matter experts to help them refine their program designs. The grand-prize winner received $250,000, the first runner-up received $200,000, and three runners-up received $100,000.
Following the challenge, the U.S. Department of Education launched a self-paced online learning course via LINCS. This course is designed to help adult education providers develop new pre-apprenticeships, as well as support providers who are implementing similar integrated education and training programs.

Holiday Magic Returns to Walt Disney World in 2025: Mickey’s Very Merry Christmas Party & Disney Jollywood Nights
If a Disney holiday trip has been on your family’s wish list, this may be the perfect year to turn that dream into reality. Two of Walt Disney World’s most beloved seasonal events are officially returning in 2025—and we’re ready to help you plan every magical detail.
Mickey’s Very Merry Christmas Party and Disney Jollywood Nights are both limited-capacity, after-hours events that offer something truly special during the most festive time of year. Whether you’re traveling with little ones, teens, or just looking for a holiday getaway, these experiences can add unforgettable moments to your vacation.
Here’s everything you need to know—plus how we can help you make the most of it.
Mickey’s Very Merry Christmas Party
Held at Magic Kingdom, this party is a fan favorite for good reason. From snowfall on Main Street to dazzling fireworks and delicious holiday treats, it’s a heartwarming celebration that brings out the childlike joy in all of us.
Event Highlights:
- Mickey’s Once Upon a Christmastime Parade (complete with Santa!)
- Minnie’s Wonderful Christmastime Fireworks over Cinderella Castle
- Holiday overlays on select rides like the Jungle Cruise (aka “Jingle Cruise”)
- Shorter wait times and a festive atmosphere
- Special character appearances in seasonal outfits
Party Dates:
November 7, 10, 11, 13, 14, 16, 18, 20, 21, 25, 26, 28, 30
December 2, 4, 5, 7, 9, 11, 12, 14, 16, 18, 19, 21
Disney’s Jollywood Nights
Back by popular demand, Disney Jollywood Nights brings vintage flair and Hollywood glam to the holidays. Held at Disney’s Hollywood Studios, this limited-capacity event is ideal for guests who love unique entertainment, elevated food and drinks, and a more grown-up spin on Disney magic.
What You’ll Experience:
- Live stage shows featuring Kermit, Miss Piggy, Edna Mode, and more
- Themed lounges and DJ-led dance parties
- Rare character sightings and immersive photo opportunities
- Seasonal cocktails and small plates exclusive to the event
- Access to top attractions with much shorter wait times
Event Dates:
November 8, 15, 17, 22, 24, 29
December 1, 6, 10, 13, 17, 20, 22
Ticket Sale Dates
- July 16: Early access for guests staying at a Disney Resort hotel
- July 22: Tickets available to the general public
Both events often sell out—especially dates around Thanksgiving and mid-December—so if you’re thinking about going, now’s the time to plan.
Let’s Bring Your Holiday Trip to Life
If either of these events sounds like something your family would love, we’d be honored to help you build a Disney holiday that fits your travel style, budget, and timeline. We’re here to take care of the details, so your holiday season feels joyful, easy, and full of magic. Contact us today at <EMAIL>

We leverage cutting-edge technology to produce small batch custom CNC parts. Our advanced equipment and expertise enable us to create consistent, complex parts with tight tolerances.
