We don’t just take your specs and build out a product. We look at the design and provide input and insight based on experience. This ensures the best design at the most reasonable cost.
Custom CNC Machining Specializing in Plastics, Aluminum, Steel, and Stainless Alloys
Our manufacturing facility is equipped with a variety of CNC machines including 3-axis, 4-axis, and 5-axis capabilities, and CNC lathes. This diverse range of equipment allows us to produce everything from simple to highly complex parts for our customers. We provide the following solutions:
Providing every type of machining, from cutting to drilling to boring to milling.
Custom CNC Parts
Specializing in custom, non-standard CNC machined parts in a variety of materials.
Running small-batch production using our CNC machines to determine if the design is functional or needs modifications.
