The Werner Machine Difference
We are more than just another CNC machine shop. The longevity of our team and customer relationships, the consultation aspect of our business, our expertise in diverse materials, and our advanced CNC capabilities make us the premier machine shop in Marietta, Georgia and the surrounding areas. We stand behind our work.
Personalized Customer Service
We build strong relationships with our clients, ensuring personalized service and direct communication. The team is always available for onsite meetings and consultations to understand your needs better, offering flexible lead times to meet your project deadlines. Our ability to adapt quickly ensures that your parts are delivered on time, every time. Our customers matter, and our collaboration with you matters.
Many customers have been with us for over a decade, reflecting our commitment to quality and service. We operate like a family business with many team members knowing each other since before the company's inception. Our close-knit culture results in low turnover and many long-term clients. Our team has an average tenure of over 13 years, and we are proud to still serve our first clients from 25 years ago.
Experience and Expertise
Quality is at the heart of everything we do at Werner Machine. Our rigorous quality control ensures every part meets the highest standards of accuracy and reliability. With decades of expertise, our experienced machinists continuously invest in training to stay at the forefront of machining technology. We specialize in machining complex parts from a wide range of materials, ensuring high-quality results regardless of the material used.
“Top-notch machining services”
We've been working with Werner Machine for many years, and they’ve consistently delivered top-notch CNC machining services. Their commitment to quality, precision, and meeting our exacting specifications has made them a trusted vendor. Projects are delivered on time, and their attention to detail gives us confidence the parts are within tolerance every time. Werner Machine has always proven to be a dependable and dedicated partner.
Arcadia Equipment, LLC
“Best in Industry!”
Since they began their business 25 years ago, we have used the Team at Werner Machine to produce the highest quality CNC machined parts. We use these parts in building our custom X-Ray and Ultrasonic systems which are delivered around the world. Their quality of craftsmanship and responsiveness is “Best in Industry”!
Marietta NDT LLC
“Second to no one in the industry”
Werner Machine has been a trusted resource to Delta Sigma for machined parts for over 15 years. Their quality, craftsmanship and service are second to no one in the industry. Their timely response and on-time deliveries have always enabled us to maintain our schedules with our customers. If you have manufacturability or material questions, Rob and Victor are always willing to offer their experiences and knowledge to help you improve your designs. In a time where "on-line" manufacturing is an option, nothing beats having a machine shop that you can actually talk to the people making your parts. They have always stood by their product and continue to do so today. I highly recommend checking them out and giving them a chance to impress you as they have me over the many years.
Chief Mechanical Engineer
Delta Sigma Company
Werner Machine, a custom CNC machining facility in Marietta, Georgia, was founded 25 years ago by Victor Werner, a machining enthusiast. Starting with a tabletop mill in his basement, Victor's journey led to the establishment of Werner Machine, which now specializes in machining aluminum, plastics, steel, and stainless alloys. The company operates like a family business with a close-knit team and long-term client relationships, reflecting their commitment to quality and service.

