The direct drive from Mosman to Bowral is 70.9 mi (114 km), and should have a drive time of 1 hr 19 mins in normal traffic.
If you’re going on a road trip from Mosman to Bowral, we did the research for you and compiled some great stops along the way — with Sydney, Wollongong, Port Stephens, Kiama Municipality, Blacktown, Manly, and North Sydney, as well as top places to visit like Central Coast Aqua Park and Mount Penang Gardens, Event Park and Parklands, or the ever-popular Gosford Regional Gallery.
Visiting Mosman or Bowral? See our Mosman Trip Planner and our Bowral Trip Planner.
